# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules for ToolKit.
#
# The site is a single-page app: every route is handled by index.html so that
# deep links such as /about or /tools/word-counter resolve correctly on direct
# navigation and on refresh, rather than returning a 404.
#
# Real assets (robots.txt, sitemap.xml, ads.txt, hashed JS/CSS) are matched by
# Cloudflare's static asset handler first, so they are unaffected by this rule.

/*  /index.html  200
